  "details": "Taking pictures in 4k and higher resolution can result in severe lag if the system is not powerful enough.\n\nConsider adding option in camera config file to set image format for pictures taken.\n\nQOI image format is lossless, comparable in size to PNG (25% filesize increase), and has 20-50x encoding speedup compared to PNG.\n\nWhile I'm not certain it's the PNG encoding that lags the system I suspect it might play a role.\n\nThe format is also public domain under the CC0 License and may be freely used, as well as having very simple specification and implementation by design.\n\nAs an additional benefit increasing resolution limit from 8k in config file would become viable, if this is indeed the source of the lag for high-resolution pictures.",
